  level2Vehicles:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f93622806a1a344979b134b4e3e60798, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: da4a6e5d1554c4ea8857b7244382af00, type: 2}
  lines:
  - id: teaser
    speaker: "INTERCEPTED \xB7 KOWLOON BAY"
    text: Kowloon Bay control. The storm is closing the port tonight, but the shipment still moves. Whoever wins the city run gets the call.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f47e272ae7b74849839e234bc693025, type: 3}
  - id: portal
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Good driving. You were noticed. There is a door open ahead of you. Drive through it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d22fecf9bb9c43ca834e64f36912743, type: 3}
  - id: arrival
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Control to Driver. Signal locked. You came through clean. Welcome to Kowloon Bay.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a588dacaa644d49bdb6dcda67c3605fc, type: 3}
  - id: unlock
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: You performed well in the city, so I have another operation for you. A storm, a secured port, and a container nobody is supposed to touch. Prepare your crew.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ed3e2816c2b34048bbd14c9388c0180, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_port
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Kowloon Bay. The busiest container port on the coast. Tonight, the storm is on our side.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6861bbd823cc14d3298b531bce5190f2, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_target
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Somewhere in these stacks is container KX-7, hidden behind a false manifest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ddf2336da4389407a92fb32f91991351, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_crew
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: You drive. Control runs the job. Overwatch flies the drone.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a3b80042d54b4456a9bb4d998dcd443, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_security
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Cameras, badge gates and patrols. Stay out of sight until the box is ours.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e607e671ddc99495a80832080466d68d, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_heist
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Crack the manifest, bypass the gate, and the gantry crane lifts the container onto our truck.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b0e10db044bd42ef98703968c5a9ddb, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_alarm
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: The moment it moves, the alarm goes live, the port locks down, and the police come for you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8e5115f4d2c34065b215f0c073fe884, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_escape
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Get to the east gate, override the power, and cross the coast road before the waves close it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 25729c17b77bd43b6ac8ca6a11d4ee88, type: 3}
  - id: trailer_briefing
    speaker: THE CONTACT
    text: Bring the cargo out. Reach extraction. Don't get caught.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69e59a827b91e4a6d90954879be52f66, type: 3}
  - id: complete
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Cargo's through, Driver. That's both jobs done, the city and the harbour. Control out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a93e63b8769dd4f50af2385281bc3d29, type: 3}
